This product bundles a secret-detection ruleset derived from gitleaks
(https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks):

  Copyright (c) 2019 Zachary Rice
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The vendored ruleset lives at src/secret-scanner/rules/gitleaks.toml and is
compiled into src/secret-scanner/rules/rules.generated.ts, which ships in the
`@grafana/plugin-ui/secret-scanner` entry point. The full MIT license text is at
src/secret-scanner/rules/gitleaks-LICENSE.
